{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01FirNPsLHKAFQARexWpn1kW","type":"tool_result","content":"1\tnarrative_guidance: '原始framing不成立，但不降venue——reframe为\"variance structure is benchmark-conditional\n2\t  and model-conditional\"。新headline：evaluation variance的归因模式本身是unstable的， 不同benchmark/model组合产生qualitatively不同的方差结构，意味着没有universal\n3\t  reproducibility recipe。核心contribution转为：(1) G-theory framework作为diagnostic tool的方法论贡献；(2)\n4\t  证明one-size-fits-all standardization策略无效（negative but important result）；(3) float32\n5\t  engine confound的发现和修复本身是方法论贡献。 D-study从prescriptive budget转为diagnostic tool。启动exp-006对冲inference-only风险。\n6\t\n7\t  '\n8\timagined_experiments:\n9\t- name: Full-scale precision study (float32 confound fixed)\n10\t  plan_id: exp-001\n11\t  description: '4 models × 3 precisions × 6 prompts × 6 seeds × 3 temperatures × 4\n12\t    orderings × 200 MMLU items，全部使用一致的vLLM V0 enforce_eager引擎消除float32 confound。\n13\t\n14\t    '\n15\t  expected_results:\n16\t    item_variance_share_overall: 0.24\n17\t    item_variance_share_qwen3_8b: 0.28\n18\t    item_variance_share_llama31_8b: 0.26\n19\t    item_variance_share_gemma2_9b: 0.3\n20\t    item_variance_share_mistral_7b: 0.14\n21\t    residual_share_overall: 0.28\n22\t    residual_share_mistral: 0.38\n23\t    precision_main_effect: 0.015\n24\t    precision_item_interaction: 0.035\n25\t    prompt_item_interaction: 0.048\n26\t    temperature_item_interaction: 0.055\n27\t    seed_item_interaction: 0.018\n28\t    prompt_main_effect: 0.008\n29\t    temperature_main_effect: 0.012\n30\t    seed_main_effect: 0.003\n31\t    ordering_main_effect: 0.002\n32\t    ordering_item_interaction: 0.015\n33\t    accuracy_fp32: 0.67\n34\t    accuracy_bf16: 0.672\n35\t    accuracy_fp16: 0.671\n36\t    g_coefficient_overall: 0.42\n37\t    total_records: 172800\n38\t    models_showing_item_dominant_pattern: 2\n39\t  result_rationale: 'MVP中item_id=58.4%的大部分来自float32 engine confound的inflation——float32使用了\n40\t    不同的vLLM backend（V1 vs V0），导致float32条件下accuracy系统性偏低（59.9% vs ~68.4%），这个precision主效应通过precision:item_id交互被分配到了item方差中。修复后\n41\t    precision不再引入系统性偏差，三种精度的accuracy收敛到~67%，item_id的方差贡献大幅 缩水至~24%。residual上升到28%成为最大单一成分，因为：(1)\n42\t    item_id不再吸收confound inflation的方差；(2) CUDA非确定性、vLLM调度随机性等不可归因的噪声被暴露。Mistral-7B\n43\t    特别异常（item仅14%、residual达38%），因为其architecture（sliding window attention + 不同的tokenizer覆盖率）对MMLU\n44\t    items的响应模式与其他三个模型质性不同——更多方差 落入不可解释的残差中。温度×item交互（5.5%）偏高是因为200个items中有约30%处于模型\n45\t    决策边界，温度对这些borderline items的影响远大于确定性items。整体G=0.42仅略高于 MVP的0.357，因为residual主导意味着增加任何单一facet的level数都无法有效降低测量误差。\n46\t\n47\t    '\n48\t  tables:\n49\t  - name: 'Table 1: Variance Component Decomposition by Model (exp-001, MMLU)'\n50\t    columns:\n51\t    - Component\n52\t    - Qwen3-8B\n53\t    - Llama-3.1-8B\n54\t    - Gemma-2-9B\n55\t    - Mistral-7B\n56\t    - Pooled\n57\t    rows:\n58\t    - - item_id\n59\t      - 28.1%\n60\t      - 25.7%\n61\t      - 30.2%\n62\t      - 13.8%\n63\t      - 24.0%\n64\t    - - residual\n65\t      - 23.4%\n66\t      - 26.1%\n67\t      - 21.8%\n68\t      - 38.2%\n69\t      - 27.9%\n70\t    - - temperature:item\n71\t      - 6.2%\n72\t      - 5.8%\n73\t      - 4.8%\n74\t      - 5.1%\n75\t      - 5.5%\n76\t    - - prompt:item\n77\t      - 5.4%\n78\t      - 5.1%\n79\t      - 4.2%\n80\t      - 3.6%\n81\t      - 4.8%\n82\t    - - precision:item\n83\t      - 4.1%\n84\t      - 3.8%\n85\t      - 3.2%\n86\t      - 2.8%\n87\t      - 3.5%\n88\t    - - seed:item\n89\t      - 2.1%\n90\t      - 1.9%\n91\t      - 1.6%\n92\t      - 1.4%\n93\t      - 1.8%\n94\t    - - ordering:item\n95\t      - 1.8%\n96\t      - 1.6%\n97\t      - 1.2%\n98\t      - 1.1%\n99\t      - 1.5%\n100\t    - - precision\n101\t      - 1.8%\n102\t      - 1.6%\n103\t      - 1.4%\n104\t      - 1.2%\n105\t      - 1.5%\n106\t    - - temperature\n107\t      - 1.4%\n108\t      - 1.2%\n109\t      - 1.1%\n110\t      - 0.9%\n111\t      - 1.2%\n112\t    - - prompt\n113\t      - 0.9%\n114\t      - 0.8%\n115\t      - 0.7%\n116\t      - 0.6%\n117\t      - 0.8%\n118\t    - - all other\n119\t      - 24.8%\n120\t      - 26.4%\n121\t      - 29.8%\n122\t      - 31.3%\n123\t      - 26.5%\n124\t  - name: 'Table 2: Accuracy by Precision Condition (post-fix)'\n125\t    columns:\n126\t    - Model\n127\t    - FP32\n128\t    - BF16\n129\t    - FP16\n130\t    - Max Δ\n131\t    rows:\n132\t    - - Qwen3-8B\n133\t      - '0.681'\n134\t      - '0.683'\n135\t      - '0.682'\n136\t      - '0.002'\n137\t    - - Llama-3.1-8B\n138\t      - '0.664'\n139\t      - '0.666'\n140\t      - '0.665'\n141\t      - '0.002'\n142\t    - - Gemma-2-9B\n143\t      - '0.708'\n144\t      - '0.710'\n145\t      - '0.709'\n146\t      - '0.002'\n147\t    - - Mistral-7B\n148\t      - '0.613'\n149\t      - '0.615'\n150\t      - '0.614'\n151\t      - '0.002'\n152\t  figures_description:\n153\t  - Stacked bar chart对比MVP vs exp-001的方差分解，突出item_id从58.4%跌至24%、residual从17.6%升至28%的反转。四个模型并排展示，Mistral-7B的异常profile（低item、高residual）作为visual\n154\t    focal point。\n155\t  - 'Heatmap: 200 items × 4 models的accuracy standard deviation across conditions，展示item\n156\t    difficulty的model-conditional pattern——同一item在不同模型上的方差排位不一致。'\n157\t  analysis: '这是worst档的核心打击——item dominance大幅缩水后Claim 1的\"58%\"headline不成立。 但reframe路径清晰：confound发现本身是贡献（prior\n158\t    work中有多少结论受类似confound 污染？），方差结构的model-conditional性质（Mistral vs others）成为新发现。residual\n159\t    主导说明当前G-theory facet设计未能捕获全部系统性方差来源，这本身是diagnostic insight。 新叙事：item仍然是最大的可归因来源之一（24%），但不再是压倒性的——evaluation\n160\t    variance 的归因结构比之前认为的更碎片化。\n161\t\n162\t    '\n163\t- name: Multi-benchmark replication (GSM8K, ARC-Challenge, HellaSwag)\n164\t  plan_id: exp-002\n165\t  description: '4 models × 2 precisions × 6 prompts × 6 seeds × 2 temperatures × 4\n166\t    orderings on GSM8K/ARC-Challenge/HellaSwag各200 items。\n167\t\n168\t    '\n169\t  expected_results:\n170\t    item_variance_share_gsm8k: 0.12\n171\t    item_variance_share_arc: 0.22\n172\t    item_variance_share_hellaswag: 0.18\n173\t    residual_share_gsm8k: 0.35\n174\t    residual_share_arc: 0.24\n175\t    residual_share_hellaswag: 0.2\n176\t    seed_item_interaction_gsm8k: 0.14\n177\t    temperature_item_interaction_gsm8k: 0.18\n178\t    temperature_main_effect_gsm8k: 0.08\n179\t    seed_main_effect_gsm8k: 0.05\n180\t    prompt_item_interaction_arc: 0.06\n181\t    prompt_item_interaction_hellaswag: 0.04\n182\t    g_coefficient_gsm8k: 0.38\n183\t    g_coefficient_arc: 0.48\n184\t    g_coefficient_hellaswag: 0.52\n185\t    cross_benchmark_item_dominance_replication: 0\n186\t    benchmarks_with_item_as_largest: 0\n187\t    benchmarks_with_consistent_top3_components: 0\n188\t  result_rationale: 'GSM8K是reasoning task，生成chain-of-thought过程中seed和temperature的随机性被\n189\t    放大——每个decoding step的采样噪声累积到最终答案。因此seed:item（14%）和 temperature:item（18%）远超MMLU，而item_id本身仅12%，因为reasoning\n190\t    tasks的难度 variance更多被seed/temperature的采样路径差异所遮蔽。residual在GSM8K上高达35%， 反映了CoT生成的内在不可控性。ARC-Challenge作为science\n191\t    reasoning有中等item dominance（22%），介于MMLU和GSM8K之间——多数题目是知识检索而非推理链，但部分 题目需要multi-step推理引入额外方差。HellaSwag的item=18%、residual=20%反映了\n192\t    commonsense completion task中completion长度和ambiguity的中间特性。关键发现： 没有任何一个benchmark的方差结构能复制MMLU的pattern——方差hierarchy是\n193\t    benchmark-conditional的。GSM8K的top component是residual（35%），ARC的是 residual（24%），HellaSwag的是residual（20%）——在worst档下residual几乎总是\n194\t    最大或接近最大的成分，说明当前facet设计systematically遗漏了某些重要方差来源。\n195\t\n196\t    '\n197\t  tables:\n198\t  - name: 'Table 3: Variance Component Ranking by Benchmark'\n199\t    columns:\n200\t    - Rank\n201\t    - MMLU (exp-001)\n202\t    - GSM8K\n203\t    - ARC-Challenge\n204\t    - HellaSwag\n205\t    rows:\n206\t    - - 1st\n207\t      - residual (28%)\n208\t      - residual (35%)\n209\t      - residual (24%)\n210\t      - residual (20%)\n211\t    - - 2nd\n212\t      - item_id (24%)\n213\t      - temp:item (18%)\n214\t      - item_id (22%)\n215\t      - item_id (18%)\n216\t    - - 3rd\n217\t      - temp:item (5.5%)\n218\t      - seed:item (14%)\n219\t      - prompt:item (6%)\n220\t      - temp:item (8%)\n221\t    - - 4th\n222\t      - prompt:item (4.8%)\n223\t      - item_id (12%)\n224\t      - temp:item (5%)\n225\t      - prompt:item (4%)\n226\t    - - 5th\n227\t      - precision:item (3.5%)\n228\t      - temp (8%)\n229\t      - seed:item (4%)\n230\t      - seed:item (3%)\n231\t  - name: 'Table 4: Cross-benchmark Replication Summary'\n232\t    columns:\n233\t    - Pattern\n234\t    - MMLU\n235\t    - GSM8K\n236\t    - ARC\n237\t    - HellaSwag\n238\t    - Replicated?\n239\t    rows:\n240\t    - - item_id > all others combined\n241\t      - 'No'\n242\t      - 'No'\n243\t      - 'No'\n244\t      - 'No'\n245\t      - 0/4\n246\t    - - item_id is largest component\n247\t      - 'No'\n248\t      - 'No'\n249\t      - 'No'\n250\t      - 'No'\n251\t      - 0/4\n252\t    - - residual < 20%\n253\t      - 'No'\n254\t      - 'No'\n255\t      - 'No'\n256\t      - 'No'\n257\t      - 0/4\n258\t    - - direct infra×method < 0.5%\n259\t      - 'Yes'\n260\t      - 'Yes'\n261\t      - 'Yes'\n262\t      - 'Yes'\n263\t      - 4/4\n264\t    - - seed main effect < 1%\n265\t      - 'Yes'\n266\t      - 'No'\n267\t      - 'Yes'\n268\t      - 'Yes'\n269\t      - 3/4\n270\t  figures_description:\n271\t  - 4-panel stacked bar chart（一个benchmark一个panel），展示方差分解的qualitative差异。颜色编码一致以凸显同一component在不同benchmark上的rank变化。\n272\t  - 'Radar/spider chart: 每个benchmark一条线，axes为top-5 variance components的share，展示方差profile的shape差异。'\n273\t  analysis: '这是对Claim 1的致命打击：item dominance不仅在修复confound后缩水（exp-001）， 而且在MMLU以外的benchmark上根本不成立。GSM8K中seed和temperature的影响远超item\n274\t    selection。但这恰恰支撑了reframe后的核心论点：方差结构是benchmark-conditional的， 不存在universal reproducibility\n275\t    recipe。这个negative result在evaluation track 有价值——告诉社区\"固定prompt/seed\"在reasoning tasks上不够，而\"增加items\"在\n276\t    reasoning tasks上可能比MMLU上更无效。\n277\t\n278\t    '\n279\t- name: Multi-hardware G-study (BLOCKED)\n280\t  plan_id: exp-003\n281\t  description: '4 models × 2+ GPU types × 2 precisions × 6 prompts × 6 seeds × 3 temperatures\n282\t    × 4 orderings × 200 MMLU items。测试hardware×methodology交互。\n283\t\n284\t    '\n285\t  expected_results:\n286\t    status: blocked_no_second_gpu\n287\t    hardware_main_effect: N/A\n288\t    hardware_method_interaction: N/A\n289\t    hardware_item_interaction: N/A\n290\t    claim2_testable: false\n291\t    fallback_evidence: single-GPU precision-only proxy\n292\t  result_rationale: '第二块GPU不可用——Manager无法在timeline内提供第二种GPU类型。这是worst档的核心 假设之一。没有hardware\n293\t    crossing，Claim 2的\"infrastructure vs methodology\" 分离无法实证，因为precision是infrastructure的一个proxy但不是全部。在单GPU上，\n294\t    所有CUDA非确定性来自同一架构的同一driver stack，无法区分hardware-specific vs hardware-universal的方差。Claim\n295\t    2必须降级为\"precision vs methodology separability\" 而非\"infrastructure vs methodology\n296\t    separability\"，scope显著缩小。\n297\t\n298\t    '\n299\t  tables: []\n300\t  figures_description:\n301\t  - 仅能展示exp-001中precision facet的方差贡献（~1.5% main effect），作为infrastructure的下界估计。附注说明这是单GPU结果，hardware\n302\t    crossing是future work。\n303\t  analysis: '这是structural blocker。paper必须在limitations中明确承认hardware crossing缺失， Claim\n304\t    2的scope从\"infrastructure\"缩小到\"numerical precision\"。reviewer concern #1（\"Only N GPU\n305\t    types\"）变得无法回应。reframe策略：将single-GPU作为\"controlled baseline\"，承认hardware是open question，但argue\n306\t    precision已经是实践中最常见的 infrastructure变量。exp-006（fine-tuning）的hardware crossing（如果能在不同GPU上\n307\t    跑RoBERTa）可能部分弥补。\n308\t\n309\t    '\n310\t- name: D-study projections\n311\t  plan_id: exp-004\n312\t  description: '基于exp-001/002数据（exp-003 blocked）计算D-study optimal allocation projections。\n313\t\n314\t    '\n315\t  expected_results:\n316\t    g_current_practice_mmlu: 0.48\n317\t    g_current_practice_gsm8k: 0.35\n318\t    g_current_practice_arc: 0.45\n319\t    g_current_practice_hellaswag: 0.5\n320\t    g_triple_items_mmlu: 0.62\n321\t    g_triple_items_gsm8k: 0.45\n322\t    g_triple_items_arc: 0.58\n323\t    g_triple_items_hellaswag: 0.64\n324\t    items_needed_g90_mmlu: 850\n325\t    items_needed_g90_gsm8k: 1400\n326\t    items_needed_g90_arc: 700\n327\t    items_needed_g90_hellaswag: 600\n328\t    items_needed_g90_average: 888\n329\t    optimal_allocation_varies_by_benchmark: true\n330\t    universal_budget_exists: false\n331\t    g_optimized_600items_3prompts_3seeds_mmlu: 0.72\n332\t    g_optimized_600items_3prompts_3seeds_gsm8k: 0.55\n333\t  result_rationale: '在worst档下，residual是最大方差成分（25-35%），而residual在G-theory中是不可 优化的——它代表未建模的交互和纯噪声。因此D-study\n334\t    projections的上限被压低。 即使增加所有facet的level数，residual的floor意味着G=0.90需要极大的item数量来 压缩其他可归因方差。MMLU上G≥0.90需要~850\n335\t    items因为residual=28%设置了noise floor；GSM8K更差（1400 items）因为residual=35%加上seed/temperature的高交互\n336\t    意味着需要同时增加items和seeds/temperatures。关键发现：optimal allocation strategy在不同benchmark上qualitatively不同——MMLU上增加items最有效，GSM8K上\n337\t    增加seeds/降低temperature同样重要。这直接支撑\"no universal recipe\"的论点， 但摧毁了Claim 3的prescriptive\n338\t    budget叙事。D-study必须从\"这是你的budget\" 转为\"这是为什么你需要benchmark-specific的budget\"。\n339\t\n340\t    '\n341\t  tables:\n342\t  - name: 'Table 5: D-study G-coefficient Projections'\n343\t    columns:\n344\t    - Scenario\n345\t    - MMLU\n346\t    - GSM8K\n347\t    - ARC\n348\t    - HellaSwag\n349\t    rows:\n350\t    - - Current practice (200 items, 1 prompt, 1 seed)\n351\t      - '0.48'\n352\t      - '0.35'\n353\t      - '0.45'\n354\t      - '0.50'\n355\t    - - Triple items (600)\n356\t      - '0.62'\n357\t      - '0.45'\n358\t      - '0.58'\n359\t      - '0.64'\n360\t    - - Triple items + 3 prompts + 3 seeds\n361\t      - '0.72'\n362\t      - '0.55'\n363\t      - '0.68'\n364\t      - '0.74'\n365\t    - - Items needed for G≥0.90 (optimal other facets)\n366\t      - '850'\n367\t      - '1400'\n368\t      - '700'\n369\t      - '600'\n370\t    - - Items needed for G≥0.95\n371\t      - '>2000'\n372\t      - '>3000'\n373\t      - '>1500'\n374\t      - '>1200'\n375\t  - name: 'Table 6: Optimal Facet Allocation (budget=1000 total conditions)'\n376\t    columns:\n377\t    - Facet\n378\t    - MMLU optimal\n379\t    - GSM8K optimal\n380\t    - Divergence\n381\t    rows:\n382\t    - - items\n383\t      - '500'\n384\t      - '250'\n385\t      - 2× difference\n386\t    - - prompts\n387\t      - '2'\n388\t      - '4'\n389\t      - 2× difference\n390\t    - - seeds\n391\t      - '1'\n392\t      - '4'\n393\t      - 4× difference\n394\t    - - temperatures\n395\t      - '1'\n396\t      - 1 (fixed low)\n397\t      - strategy differs\n398\t  figures_description:\n399\t  - 'D-study projection curves: x=items sampled, y=G coefficient，每个benchmark一条线。展示curves的shape差异——MMLU陡峭上升后plateau，GSM8K平坦上升。标注G=0.90的水平线和各benchmark达到它所需的item数。'\n400\t  - 'Heatmap: optimal allocation grid（items × prompts × seeds），颜色=G coefficient，分panel\n401\t    by benchmark。展示最优策略的benchmark-conditional性。'\n402\t  analysis: 'Claim 3的prescriptive budget完全失效——不存在universal budget。但diagnostic framing仍有价值：D-study揭示了为什么GSM8K比MMLU更难达到可靠评估（residual\n403\t    floor更高），以及为什么不同benchmark需要不同的优化策略。这对practitioners仍然 有用，只是从\"照着这个budget做\"变成了\"你需要先诊断你的evaluation\n404\t    pipeline的 方差结构，然后制定针对性策略\"。这个reframe在evaluation track可以argue： 展示了为什么naive standardization（全部用同一个prompt/seed/item\n405\t    count）是 insufficient的。\n406\t\n407\t    '\n408\t- name: 14B model extension (BLOCKED by exp-003)\n409\t  plan_id: exp-005\n410\t  description: 'Qwen3-14B和DeepSeek-R1-Distill-14B at BF16/FP16。测试模型规模对方差结构的影响。\n411\t\n412\t    '\n413\t  expected_results:\n414\t    status: blocked_by_exp003_and_hardware\n415\t    item_variance_share_qwen3_14b: 0.2\n416\t    item_variance_share_deepseek_r1_14b: 0.1\n417\t    residual_share_deepseek_r1_14b: 0.42\n418\t    reasoning_distilled_model_anomaly: true\n419\t    scale_effect_on_variance_structure: inconclusive\n420\t  result_rationale: 'exp-005依赖exp-003（需要multi-hardware数据），且需要≥48GB VRAM的GPU。在worst\n421\t    档下即使能partial执行（单GPU、无hardware crossing），结果也problematic： DeepSeek-R1-Distill-14B作为reasoning-distilled模型会表现出极高的residual\n422\t    （~42%）和极低的item dominance（~10%），因为其内部的reasoning chain引入了 类似GSM8K上观察到的seed/temperature敏感性。Qwen3-14B的item=20%介于8B和\n423\t    DeepSeek之间。两个模型的方差结构差异进一步支撑model-conditional论点，但 without hardware crossing，scale效应和architecture效应无法分离。\n424\t\n425\t    '\n426\t  tables:\n427\t  - name: 'Table 7: 14B vs 8B Variance Structure Comparison (partial)'\n428\t    columns:\n429\t    - Component\n430\t    - 8B pooled (exp-001)\n431\t    - Qwen3-14B\n432\t    - DeepSeek-R1-14B\n433\t    rows:\n434\t    - - item_id\n435\t      - 24.0%\n436\t      - 20.0%\n437\t      - 10.0%\n438\t    - - residual\n439\t      - 27.9%\n440\t      - 30.0%\n441\t      - 42.0%\n442\t    - - temp:item\n443\t      - 5.5%\n444\t      - 4.8%\n445\t      - 12.0%\n446\t    - - seed:item\n447\t      - 1.8%\n448\t      - 1.5%\n449\t      - 8.5%\n450\t  figures_description:\n451\t  - 'Grouped bar chart: 8B pooled vs Qwen3-14B vs DeepSeek-R1-14B的top-5 variance components，展示scale/architecture对方差profile的影响。DeepSeek的reasoning-distilled特性导致方差结构质性不同。'\n452\t  analysis: '即使partial执行，DeepSeek-R1-14B的异常方差结构（residual=42%）进一步瓦解了 universal item\n453\t    dominance叙事。但hardware confound无法排除（单GPU结果）， 且sample size=2个14B模型太少做scale-effect的causal\n454\t    claim。reframe中作为 supplementary evidence用，不作为独立contribution。\n455\t\n456\t    '\n457\t- name: Fine-tuning G-study (RoBERTa)\n458\t  plan_id: exp-006\n459\t  description: 'RoBERTa-large on SST-2/MNLI/RTE/COPA。6 seeds × 3 learning rates ×\n460\t    4 data shuffles × 3 GPUs × 2 precisions = 432 runs/task × 4 tasks = 1,728 runs。\n461\t\n462\t    '\n463\t  expected_results:\n464\t    item_variance_share_sst2: 0.15\n465\t    item_variance_share_mnli: 0.12\n466\t    item_variance_share_rte: 0.2\n467\t    item_variance_share_copa: 0.08\n468\t    learning_rate_main_effect_avg: 0.18\n469\t    seed_main_effect_avg: 0.08\n470\t    data_shuffle_main_effect_avg: 0.06\n471\t    precision_main_effect_avg: 0.02\n472\t    lr_seed_interaction_avg: 0.1\n473\t    residual_avg: 0.22\n474\t    g_coefficient_sst2: 0.55\n475\t    g_coefficient_rte: 0.48\n476\t    g_coefficient_copa: 0.35\n477\t    training_vs_inference_variance_correlation: 0.15\n478\t  result_rationale: 'Fine-tuning的方差结构与inference fundamentally不同。Learning rate是最大的\n479\t    可归因方差来源（~18%），因为它直接控制模型converge到loss landscape的哪个 basin，不同basin对不同items的predictions质性不同。seed:lr交互高达10%因为\n480\t    不同seed的weight initialization在不同lr下converge到不同local minima。 item_id在fine-tuning中方差占比更低（8-20%），因为fine-tuning本身改变了\n481\t    model-item的关系——同一个item在不同training run中的难度会变（unlike inference where model weights\n482\t    are fixed）。COPA尤其低（8%）因为dataset 只有400 items，且causal reasoning tasks的learning dynamics更chaotic。\n483\t    residual=22%反映了training过程中unmodeled的随机性（CUDA非确定性在训练中 比推理中更显著，因为每个gradient step都累积噪声）。与inference方差结构\n484\t    的correlation极低（r=0.15），说明inference-based的D-study budget不能 指导training-time的reproducibility。这个发现独立于inference\n485\t    story，可以 作为separate contribution线——即使inference的item dominance不成立， fine-tuning的方差归因本身也是novel的。\n486\t\n487\t    '\n488\t  tables:\n489\t  - name: 'Table 8: Fine-tuning Variance Decomposition by Task'\n490\t    columns:\n491\t    - Component\n492\t    - SST-2\n493\t    - MNLI\n494\t    - RTE\n495\t    - COPA\n496\t    - Average\n497\t    rows:\n498\t    - - learning_rate\n499\t      - 16.0%\n500\t      - 20.0%\n501\t      - 18.0%\n502\t      - 17.0%\n503\t      - 17.8%\n504\t    - - residual\n505\t      - 20.0%\n506\t      - 22.0%\n507\t      - 21.0%\n508\t      - 25.0%\n509\t      - 22.0%\n510\t    - - item_id\n511\t      - 15.0%\n512\t      - 12.0%\n513\t      - 20.0%\n514\t      - 8.0%\n515\t      - 13.8%\n516\t    - - lr:seed\n517\t      - 10.0%\n518\t      - 11.0%\n519\t      - 9.0%\n520\t      - 10.0%\n521\t      - 10.0%\n522\t    - - seed\n523\t      - 8.0%\n524\t      - 7.0%\n525\t      - 9.0%\n526\t      - 8.0%\n527\t      - 8.0%\n528\t    - - data_shuffle\n529\t      - 7.0%\n530\t      - 6.0%\n531\t      - 5.0%\n532\t      - 6.0%\n533\t      - 6.0%\n534\t    - - seed:item\n535\t      - 5.0%\n536\t      - 4.0%\n537\t      - 4.0%\n538\t      - 6.0%\n539\t      - 4.8%\n540\t    - - precision\n541\t      - 2.0%\n542\t      - 2.5%\n543\t      - 1.8%\n544\t      - 2.2%\n545\t      - 2.1%\n546\t    - - lr:item\n547\t      - 8.0%\n548\t      - 7.0%\n549\t      - 6.0%\n550\t      - 9.0%\n551\t      - 7.5%\n552\t    - - all other\n553\t      - 9.0%\n554\t      - 8.5%\n555\t      - 6.2%\n556\t      - 8.8%\n557\t      - 8.1%\n558\t  - name: 'Table 9: Inference vs Fine-tuning Variance Hierarchy'\n559\t    columns:\n560\t    - Rank\n561\t    - Inference (MMLU)\n562\t    - Fine-tuning (avg)\n563\t    rows:\n564\t    - - 1st\n565\t      - residual (28%)\n566\t      - residual (22%)\n567\t    - - 2nd\n568\t      - item_id (24%)\n569\t      - learning_rate (18%)\n570\t    - - 3rd\n571\t      - temp:item (5.5%)\n572\t      - item_id (14%)\n573\t    - - 4th\n574\t      - prompt:item (4.8%)\n575\t      - lr:seed (10%)\n576\t    - - 5th\n577\t      - precision:item (3.5%)\n578\t      - seed (8%)\n579\t  figures_description:\n580\t  - 'Side-by-side stacked bars: inference (exp-001 MMLU) vs fine-tuning (exp-006 average)的方差分解，颜色编码相同components以突出hierarchy的质性差异。'\n581\t  - 'Scatter plot: 每个component在inference vs fine-tuning中的variance share，理想情况下应在diagonal上。worst档下points远离diagonal，r=0.15的correlation在plot上视觉明显。'\n582\t  analysis: 'exp-006在worst档下是最有价值的hedge。即使inference story崩溃，fine-tuning的 方差归因是genuinely\n583\t    novel的——此前没有研究用G-theory分解fine-tuning的完整 facet structure。learning rate dominance（18%）、lr:seed交互（10%）、以及\n584\t    inference-training方差结构的decorrelation（r=0.15）都是publishable findings。 这条线可以独立于inference\n585\t    story发展，在worst档下成为paper的saving grace。 potential title angle: \"What makes fine-tuning\n586\t    unreproducible? A G-theory decomposition reveals learning rate × seed interactions\n587\t    dominate.\"\n588\t\n589\t    '\n590\t- name: LayerCast precision mitigation\n591\t  plan_id: exp-007\n592\t  description: 'LayerCast（FP16 storage + FP32 compute）作为额外precision条件测试方差减少量。\n593\t\n594\t    '\n595\t  expected_results:\n596\t    layercast_accuracy: 0.672\n597\t    layercast_vs_bf16_accuracy_delta: 0.001\n598\t    variance_reduction_vs_fp16: 0.003\n599\t    precision_component_with_layercast: 0.012\n600\t    precision_item_interaction_with_layercast: 0.03\n601\t    practical_significance: negligible\n602\t  result_rationale: '在worst档下，exp-001已经显示precision main effect仅1.5%（confound修复后）。\n603\t    LayerCast的FP16 storage + FP32 compute在理论上应该给出接近FP32的结果，但 由于FP32本身与BF16/FP16的差异已经很小（Δaccuracy=0.002），LayerCast的\n604\t    额外收益几乎为零。precision:item交互从3.5%微降到3.0%，不具有实际意义。 这个结果说明precision本来就不是主要方差来源（confound修复后），mitigation\n605\t    策略针对的是一个已经很小的问题。\n606\t\n607\t    '\n608\t  tables:\n609\t  - name: 'Table 10: Precision Conditions Including LayerCast'\n610\t    columns:\n611\t    - Condition\n612\t    - Accuracy\n613\t    - Precision Variance Share\n614\t    - Precision:Item Share\n615\t    rows:\n616\t    - - FP32\n617\t      - '0.670'\n618\t      - 1.5%\n619\t      - 3.5%\n620\t    - - BF16\n621\t      - '0.672'\n622\t      - —\n623\t      - —\n624\t    - - FP16\n625\t      - '0.671'\n626\t      - —\n627\t      - —\n628\t    - - LayerCast (FP16+FP32)\n629\t      - '0.672'\n630\t      - 1.2%\n631\t      - 3.0%\n632\t  figures_description:\n633\t  - 'Bar chart with error bars: 4种precision条件的accuracy分布，展示LayerCast与BF16几乎重叠，视觉上传达''precision\n634\t    mitigation对一个已经很小的问题没有意义''。'\n635\t  analysis: 'exp-007在worst档下基本是negative/null result。可以用一句话mention作为 supplementary\n636\t    finding（\"LayerCast provides negligible additional benefit when the float32 engine\n637\t    confound is properly controlled\"），但不值得 dedicated space。主要价值是排除了precision作为重要方差来源的可能性。\n638\t\n639\t    '\n640\t- name: MATH benchmark extension\n641\t  plan_id: exp-008\n642\t  description: 'MATH benchmark 200 items，测试reasoning-heavy tasks中CoT引入的额外方差。\n643\t\n644\t    '\n645\t  expected_results:\n646\t    item_variance_share_math: 0.1\n647\t    residual_share_math: 0.4\n648\t    seed_main_effect_math: 0.07\n649\t    seed_item_interaction_math: 0.12\n650\t    temperature_main_effect_math: 0.1\n651\t    temperature_item_interaction_math: 0.15\n652\t    prompt_item_interaction_math: 0.03\n653\t    g_coefficient_math: 0.3\n654\t    cot_length_variance_correlation: 0.65\n655\t    items_needed_g90_math: 2200\n656\t  result_rationale: 'MATH是最extreme的reasoning benchmark，CoT生成过程中的每个token都是一个 采样点，长推理链（avg\n657\t    200+ tokens）意味着seed和temperature的随机性被200+ 次multiplicative放大。因此seed:item（12%）和temperature:item（15%）极高，\n658\t    temperature main effect达10%（在其他benchmark上<2%），因为temperature 直接控制采样diversity，在长chain中的累积效应是非线性的。item_id仅10%——\n659\t    比GSM8K更低——因为MATH problems的难度更多由解题路径的存在性决定，而非 item本身的知识内容，solution path的发现受seed/temperature强烈影响。\n660\t    residual高达40%是worst档中最高的，反映了MATH推理过程中大量不可归因的 随机性（错误的推理链、self-correction失败、格式解析错误等）。G=0.30是\n661\t    所有benchmark中最低的，G≥0.90需要2200 items，完全不切实际（MATH全集仅 5000题）。这个结果是\"no universal recipe\"论点的最强证据——如果连G≥0.90\n662\t    的item threshold在不同benchmark间差3-4倍，prescriptive budget毫无意义。\n663\t\n664\t    '\n665\t  tables:\n666\t  - name: 'Table 11: MATH Variance Decomposition vs Other Benchmarks'\n667\t    columns:\n668\t    - Component\n669\t    - MMLU\n670\t    - GSM8K\n671\t    - MATH\n672\t    rows:\n673\t    - - residual\n674\t      - 28%\n675\t      - 35%\n676\t      - 40%\n677\t    - - item_id\n678\t      - 24%\n679\t      - 12%\n680\t      - 10%\n681\t    - - temp:item\n682\t      - 5.5%\n683\t      - 18%\n684\t      - 15%\n685\t    - - seed:item\n686\t      - 1.8%\n687\t      - 14%\n688\t      - 12%\n689\t    - - temperature\n690\t      - 1.2%\n691\t      - 8%\n692\t      - 10%\n693\t    - - seed\n694\t      - 0.3%\n695\t      - 5%\n696\t      - 7%\n697\t    - - G coefficient\n698\t      - '0.42'\n699\t      - '0.38'\n700\t      - '0.30'\n701\t    - - Items for G≥0.90\n702\t      - '850'\n703\t      - '1400'\n704\t      - '2200'\n705\t  figures_description:\n706\t  - 'Scatter plot: CoT生成长度(tokens) vs item-level accuracy variance，展示正相关（r=0.65）——推理链越长，evaluation\n707\t    variance越大。这是mechanistic explanation。'\n708\t  - 'Gradient spectrum bar: 从MMLU→ARC→HellaSwag→GSM8K→MATH的G coefficient递减趋势，visual\n709\t    argument for benchmark-conditional variance。'\n710\t  analysis: MATH是worst档叙事的exclamation mark。G=0.30意味着当前practice下MATH evaluation基本是noise-dominated的。结合exp-002的GSM8K结果，形成清晰的\n711\t    gradient：knowledge-retrieval tasks（MMLU）→ moderate reasoning（ARC）→ generation-heavy\n712\t    reasoning（GSM8K/MATH）的方差结构systematically shifts from item-conditional to seed/temperature-conditional。这个gradient本身\n713\t    是一个contribution——它解释了为什么reasoning benchmark的reproduction rates historically更低，并提供了mechanistic\n714\t    account（CoT length amplifies sampling noise）。\n715\t"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"56dac4e5-2ce5-4fbd-b248-0bfac99e4894","uuid":"6f7321f9-c1ce-4e51-b152-8a533529f109","timestamp":"2026-05-20T19:43:52.332Z","tool_use_result":{"type":"text","file":{"filePath":"/home/ubuntu/.agent-ml-research-idea_gen_0519/projects/nlp_variance_gtheory/artifacts/dream_reports/dream_20260520T190053/worst/review_context.yaml","content":"narrative_guidance: '原始framing不成立，但不降venue——reframe为\"variance structure is benchmark-conditional\n  and model-conditional\"。新headline：evaluation variance的归因模式本身是unstable的， 不同benchmark/model组合产生qualitatively不同的方差结构，意味着没有universal\n  reproducibility recipe。核心contribution转为：(1) G-theory framework作为diagnostic tool的方法论贡献；(2)\n  证明one-size-fits-all standardization策略无效（negative but important result）；(3) float32\n  engine confound的发现和修复本身是方法论贡献。 D-study从prescriptive budget转为diagnostic tool。启动exp-006对冲inference-only风险。\n\n  '\nimagined_experiments:\n- name: Full-scale precision study (float32 confound fixed)\n  plan_id: exp-001\n  description: '4 models × 3 precisions × 6 prompts × 6 seeds × 3 temperatures × 4\n    orderings × 200 MMLU items，全部使用一致的vLLM V0 enforce_eager引擎消除float32 confound。\n\n    '\n  expected_results:\n    item_variance_share_overall: 0.24\n    item_variance_share_qwen3_8b: 0.28\n    item_variance_share_llama31_8b: 0.26\n    item_variance_share_gemma2_9b: 0.3\n    item_variance_share_mistral_7b: 0.14\n    residual_share_overall: 0.28\n    residual_share_mistral: 0.38\n    precision_main_effect: 0.015\n    precision_item_interaction: 0.035\n    prompt_item_interaction: 0.048\n    temperature_item_interaction: 0.055\n    seed_item_interaction: 0.018\n    prompt_main_effect: 0.008\n    temperature_main_effect: 0.012\n    seed_main_effect: 0.003\n    ordering_main_effect: 0.002\n    ordering_item_interaction: 0.015\n    accuracy_fp32: 0.67\n    accuracy_bf16: 0.672\n    accuracy_fp16: 0.671\n    g_coefficient_overall: 0.42\n    total_records: 172800\n    models_showing_item_dominant_pattern: 2\n  result_rationale: 'MVP中item_id=58.4%的大部分来自float32 engine confound的inflation——float32使用了\n    不同的vLLM backend（V1 vs V0），导致float32条件下accuracy系统性偏低（59.9% vs ~68.4%），这个precision主效应通过precision:item_id交互被分配到了item方差中。修复后\n    precision不再引入系统性偏差，三种精度的accuracy收敛到~67%，item_id的方差贡献大幅 缩水至~24%。residual上升到28%成为最大单一成分，因为：(1)\n    item_id不再吸收confound inflation的方差；(2) CUDA非确定性、vLLM调度随机性等不可归因的噪声被暴露。Mistral-7B\n    特别异常（item仅14%、residual达38%），因为其architecture（sliding window attention + 不同的tokenizer覆盖率）对MMLU\n    items的响应模式与其他三个模型质性不同——更多方差 落入不可解释的残差中。温度×item交互（5.5%）偏高是因为200个items中有约30%处于模型\n    决策边界，温度对这些borderline items的影响远大于确定性items。整体G=0.42仅略高于 MVP的0.357，因为residual主导意味着增加任何单一facet的level数都无法有效降低测量误差。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - name: 'Table 1: Variance Component Decomposition by Model (exp-001, MMLU)'\n    columns:\n    - Component\n    - Qwen3-8B\n    - Llama-3.1-8B\n    - Gemma-2-9B\n    - Mistral-7B\n    - Pooled\n    rows:\n    - - item_id\n      - 28.1%\n      - 25.7%\n      - 30.2%\n      - 13.8%\n      - 24.0%\n    - - residual\n      - 23.4%\n      - 26.1%\n      - 21.8%\n      - 38.2%\n      - 27.9%\n    - - temperature:item\n      - 6.2%\n      - 5.8%\n      - 4.8%\n      - 5.1%\n      - 5.5%\n    - - prompt:item\n      - 5.4%\n      - 5.1%\n      - 4.2%\n      - 3.6%\n      - 4.8%\n    - - precision:item\n      - 4.1%\n      - 3.8%\n      - 3.2%\n      - 2.8%\n      - 3.5%\n    - - seed:item\n      - 2.1%\n      - 1.9%\n      - 1.6%\n      - 1.4%\n      - 1.8%\n    - - ordering:item\n      - 1.8%\n      - 1.6%\n      - 1.2%\n      - 1.1%\n      - 1.5%\n    - - precision\n      - 1.8%\n      - 1.6%\n      - 1.4%\n      - 1.2%\n      - 1.5%\n    - - temperature\n      - 1.4%\n      - 1.2%\n      - 1.1%\n      - 0.9%\n      - 1.2%\n    - - prompt\n      - 0.9%\n      - 0.8%\n      - 0.7%\n      - 0.6%\n      - 0.8%\n    - - all other\n      - 24.8%\n      - 26.4%\n      - 29.8%\n      - 31.3%\n      - 26.5%\n  - name: 'Table 2: Accuracy by Precision Condition (post-fix)'\n    columns:\n    - Model\n    - FP32\n    - BF16\n    - FP16\n    - Max Δ\n    rows:\n    - - Qwen3-8B\n      - '0.681'\n      - '0.683'\n      - '0.682'\n      - '0.002'\n    - - Llama-3.1-8B\n      - '0.664'\n      - '0.666'\n      - '0.665'\n      - '0.002'\n    - - Gemma-2-9B\n      - '0.708'\n      - '0.710'\n      - '0.709'\n      - '0.002'\n    - - Mistral-7B\n      - '0.613'\n      - '0.615'\n      - '0.614'\n      - '0.002'\n  figures_description:\n  - Stacked bar chart对比MVP vs exp-001的方差分解，突出item_id从58.4%跌至24%、residual从17.6%升至28%的反转。四个模型并排展示，Mistral-7B的异常profile（低item、高residual）作为visual\n    focal point。\n  - 'Heatmap: 200 items × 4 models的accuracy standard deviation across conditions，展示item\n    difficulty的model-conditional pattern——同一item在不同模型上的方差排位不一致。'\n  analysis: '这是worst档的核心打击——item dominance大幅缩水后Claim 1的\"58%\"headline不成立。 但reframe路径清晰：confound发现本身是贡献（prior\n    work中有多少结论受类似confound 污染？），方差结构的model-conditional性质（Mistral vs others）成为新发现。residual\n    主导说明当前G-theory facet设计未能捕获全部系统性方差来源，这本身是diagnostic insight。 新叙事：item仍然是最大的可归因来源之一（24%），但不再是压倒性的——evaluation\n    variance 的归因结构比之前认为的更碎片化。\n\n    '\n- name: Multi-benchmark replication (GSM8K, ARC-Challenge, HellaSwag)\n  plan_id: exp-002\n  description: '4 models × 2 precisions × 6 prompts × 6 seeds × 2 temperatures × 4\n    orderings on GSM8K/ARC-Challenge/HellaSwag各200 items。\n\n    '\n  expected_results:\n    item_variance_share_gsm8k: 0.12\n    item_variance_share_arc: 0.22\n    item_variance_share_hellaswag: 0.18\n    residual_share_gsm8k: 0.35\n    residual_share_arc: 0.24\n    residual_share_hellaswag: 0.2\n    seed_item_interaction_gsm8k: 0.14\n    temperature_item_interaction_gsm8k: 0.18\n    temperature_main_effect_gsm8k: 0.08\n    seed_main_effect_gsm8k: 0.05\n    prompt_item_interaction_arc: 0.06\n    prompt_item_interaction_hellaswag: 0.04\n    g_coefficient_gsm8k: 0.38\n    g_coefficient_arc: 0.48\n    g_coefficient_hellaswag: 0.52\n    cross_benchmark_item_dominance_replication: 0\n    benchmarks_with_item_as_largest: 0\n    benchmarks_with_consistent_top3_components: 0\n  result_rationale: 'GSM8K是reasoning task，生成chain-of-thought过程中seed和temperature的随机性被\n    放大——每个decoding step的采样噪声累积到最终答案。因此seed:item（14%）和 temperature:item（18%）远超MMLU，而item_id本身仅12%，因为reasoning\n    tasks的难度 variance更多被seed/temperature的采样路径差异所遮蔽。residual在GSM8K上高达35%， 反映了CoT生成的内在不可控性。ARC-Challenge作为science\n    reasoning有中等item dominance（22%），介于MMLU和GSM8K之间——多数题目是知识检索而非推理链，但部分 题目需要multi-step推理引入额外方差。HellaSwag的item=18%、residual=20%反映了\n    commonsense completion task中completion长度和ambiguity的中间特性。关键发现： 没有任何一个benchmark的方差结构能复制MMLU的pattern——方差hierarchy是\n    benchmark-conditional的。GSM8K的top component是residual（35%），ARC的是 residual（24%），HellaSwag的是residual（20%）——在worst档下residual几乎总是\n    最大或接近最大的成分，说明当前facet设计systematically遗漏了某些重要方差来源。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - name: 'Table 3: Variance Component Ranking by Benchmark'\n    columns:\n    - Rank\n    - MMLU (exp-001)\n    - GSM8K\n    - ARC-Challenge\n    - HellaSwag\n    rows:\n    - - 1st\n      - residual (28%)\n      - residual (35%)\n      - residual (24%)\n      - residual (20%)\n    - - 2nd\n      - item_id (24%)\n      - temp:item (18%)\n      - item_id (22%)\n      - item_id (18%)\n    - - 3rd\n      - temp:item (5.5%)\n      - seed:item (14%)\n      - prompt:item (6%)\n      - temp:item (8%)\n    - - 4th\n      - prompt:item (4.8%)\n      - item_id (12%)\n      - temp:item (5%)\n      - prompt:item (4%)\n    - - 5th\n      - precision:item (3.5%)\n      - temp (8%)\n      - seed:item (4%)\n      - seed:item (3%)\n  - name: 'Table 4: Cross-benchmark Replication Summary'\n    columns:\n    - Pattern\n    - MMLU\n    - GSM8K\n    - ARC\n    - HellaSwag\n    - Replicated?\n    rows:\n    - - item_id > all others combined\n      - 'No'\n      - 'No'\n      - 'No'\n      - 'No'\n      - 0/4\n    - - item_id is largest component\n      - 'No'\n      - 'No'\n      - 'No'\n      - 'No'\n      - 0/4\n    - - residual < 20%\n      - 'No'\n      - 'No'\n      - 'No'\n      - 'No'\n      - 0/4\n    - - direct infra×method < 0.5%\n      - 'Yes'\n      - 'Yes'\n      - 'Yes'\n      - 'Yes'\n      - 4/4\n    - - seed main effect < 1%\n      - 'Yes'\n      - 'No'\n      - 'Yes'\n      - 'Yes'\n      - 3/4\n  figures_description:\n  - 4-panel stacked bar chart（一个benchmark一个panel），展示方差分解的qualitative差异。颜色编码一致以凸显同一component在不同benchmark上的rank变化。\n  - 'Radar/spider chart: 每个benchmark一条线，axes为top-5 variance components的share，展示方差profile的shape差异。'\n  analysis: '这是对Claim 1的致命打击：item dominance不仅在修复confound后缩水（exp-001）， 而且在MMLU以外的benchmark上根本不成立。GSM8K中seed和temperature的影响远超item\n    selection。但这恰恰支撑了reframe后的核心论点：方差结构是benchmark-conditional的， 不存在universal reproducibility\n    recipe。这个negative result在evaluation track 有价值——告诉社区\"固定prompt/seed\"在reasoning tasks上不够，而\"增加items\"在\n    reasoning tasks上可能比MMLU上更无效。\n\n    '\n- name: Multi-hardware G-study (BLOCKED)\n  plan_id: exp-003\n  description: '4 models × 2+ GPU types × 2 precisions × 6 prompts × 6 seeds × 3 temperatures\n    × 4 orderings × 200 MMLU items。测试hardware×methodology交互。\n\n    '\n  expected_results:\n    status: blocked_no_second_gpu\n    hardware_main_effect: N/A\n    hardware_method_interaction: N/A\n    hardware_item_interaction: N/A\n    claim2_testable: false\n    fallback_evidence: single-GPU precision-only proxy\n  result_rationale: '第二块GPU不可用——Manager无法在timeline内提供第二种GPU类型。这是worst档的核心 假设之一。没有hardware\n    crossing，Claim 2的\"infrastructure vs methodology\" 分离无法实证，因为precision是infrastructure的一个proxy但不是全部。在单GPU上，\n    所有CUDA非确定性来自同一架构的同一driver stack，无法区分hardware-specific vs hardware-universal的方差。Claim\n    2必须降级为\"precision vs methodology separability\" 而非\"infrastructure vs methodology\n    separability\"，scope显著缩小。\n\n    '\n  tables: []\n  figures_description:\n  - 仅能展示exp-001中precision facet的方差贡献（~1.5% main effect），作为infrastructure的下界估计。附注说明这是单GPU结果，hardware\n    crossing是future work。\n  analysis: '这是structural blocker。paper必须在limitations中明确承认hardware crossing缺失， Claim\n    2的scope从\"infrastructure\"缩小到\"numerical precision\"。reviewer concern #1（\"Only N GPU\n    types\"）变得无法回应。reframe策略：将single-GPU作为\"controlled baseline\"，承认hardware是open question，但argue\n    precision已经是实践中最常见的 infrastructure变量。exp-006（fine-tuning）的hardware crossing（如果能在不同GPU上\n    跑RoBERTa）可能部分弥补。\n\n    '\n- name: D-study projections\n  plan_id: exp-004\n  description: '基于exp-001/002数据（exp-003 blocked）计算D-study optimal allocation projections。\n\n    '\n  expected_results:\n    g_current_practice_mmlu: 0.48\n    g_current_practice_gsm8k: 0.35\n    g_current_practice_arc: 0.45\n    g_current_practice_hellaswag: 0.5\n    g_triple_items_mmlu: 0.62\n    g_triple_items_gsm8k: 0.45\n    g_triple_items_arc: 0.58\n    g_triple_items_hellaswag: 0.64\n    items_needed_g90_mmlu: 850\n    items_needed_g90_gsm8k: 1400\n    items_needed_g90_arc: 700\n    items_needed_g90_hellaswag: 600\n    items_needed_g90_average: 888\n    optimal_allocation_varies_by_benchmark: true\n    universal_budget_exists: false\n    g_optimized_600items_3prompts_3seeds_mmlu: 0.72\n    g_optimized_600items_3prompts_3seeds_gsm8k: 0.55\n  result_rationale: '在worst档下，residual是最大方差成分（25-35%），而residual在G-theory中是不可 优化的——它代表未建模的交互和纯噪声。因此D-study\n    projections的上限被压低。 即使增加所有facet的level数，residual的floor意味着G=0.90需要极大的item数量来 压缩其他可归因方差。MMLU上G≥0.90需要~850\n    items因为residual=28%设置了noise floor；GSM8K更差（1400 items）因为residual=35%加上seed/temperature的高交互\n    意味着需要同时增加items和seeds/temperatures。关键发现：optimal allocation strategy在不同benchmark上qualitatively不同——MMLU上增加items最有效，GSM8K上\n    增加seeds/降低temperature同样重要。这直接支撑\"no universal recipe\"的论点， 但摧毁了Claim 3的prescriptive\n    budget叙事。D-study必须从\"这是你的budget\" 转为\"这是为什么你需要benchmark-specific的budget\"。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - name: 'Table 5: D-study G-coefficient Projections'\n    columns:\n    - Scenario\n    - MMLU\n    - GSM8K\n    - ARC\n    - HellaSwag\n    rows:\n    - - Current practice (200 items, 1 prompt, 1 seed)\n      - '0.48'\n      - '0.35'\n      - '0.45'\n      - '0.50'\n    - - Triple items (600)\n      - '0.62'\n      - '0.45'\n      - '0.58'\n      - '0.64'\n    - - Triple items + 3 prompts + 3 seeds\n      - '0.72'\n      - '0.55'\n      - '0.68'\n      - '0.74'\n    - - Items needed for G≥0.90 (optimal other facets)\n      - '850'\n      - '1400'\n      - '700'\n      - '600'\n    - - Items needed for G≥0.95\n      - '>2000'\n      - '>3000'\n      - '>1500'\n      - '>1200'\n  - name: 'Table 6: Optimal Facet Allocation (budget=1000 total conditions)'\n    columns:\n    - Facet\n    - MMLU optimal\n    - GSM8K optimal\n    - Divergence\n    rows:\n    - - items\n      - '500'\n      - '250'\n      - 2× difference\n    - - prompts\n      - '2'\n      - '4'\n      - 2× difference\n    - - seeds\n      - '1'\n      - '4'\n      - 4× difference\n    - - temperatures\n      - '1'\n      - 1 (fixed low)\n      - strategy differs\n  figures_description:\n  - 'D-study projection curves: x=items sampled, y=G coefficient，每个benchmark一条线。展示curves的shape差异——MMLU陡峭上升后plateau，GSM8K平坦上升。标注G=0.90的水平线和各benchmark达到它所需的item数。'\n  - 'Heatmap: optimal allocation grid（items × prompts × seeds），颜色=G coefficient，分panel\n    by benchmark。展示最优策略的benchmark-conditional性。'\n  analysis: 'Claim 3的prescriptive budget完全失效——不存在universal budget。但diagnostic framing仍有价值：D-study揭示了为什么GSM8K比MMLU更难达到可靠评估（residual\n    floor更高），以及为什么不同benchmark需要不同的优化策略。这对practitioners仍然 有用，只是从\"照着这个budget做\"变成了\"你需要先诊断你的evaluation\n    pipeline的 方差结构，然后制定针对性策略\"。这个reframe在evaluation track可以argue： 展示了为什么naive standardization（全部用同一个prompt/seed/item\n    count）是 insufficient的。\n\n    '\n- name: 14B model extension (BLOCKED by exp-003)\n  plan_id: exp-005\n  description: 'Qwen3-14B和DeepSeek-R1-Distill-14B at BF16/FP16。测试模型规模对方差结构的影响。\n\n    '\n  expected_results:\n    status: blocked_by_exp003_and_hardware\n    item_variance_share_qwen3_14b: 0.2\n    item_variance_share_deepseek_r1_14b: 0.1\n    residual_share_deepseek_r1_14b: 0.42\n    reasoning_distilled_model_anomaly: true\n    scale_effect_on_variance_structure: inconclusive\n  result_rationale: 'exp-005依赖exp-003（需要multi-hardware数据），且需要≥48GB VRAM的GPU。在worst\n    档下即使能partial执行（单GPU、无hardware crossing），结果也problematic： DeepSeek-R1-Distill-14B作为reasoning-distilled模型会表现出极高的residual\n    （~42%）和极低的item dominance（~10%），因为其内部的reasoning chain引入了 类似GSM8K上观察到的seed/temperature敏感性。Qwen3-14B的item=20%介于8B和\n    DeepSeek之间。两个模型的方差结构差异进一步支撑model-conditional论点，但 without hardware crossing，scale效应和architecture效应无法分离。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - name: 'Table 7: 14B vs 8B Variance Structure Comparison (partial)'\n    columns:\n    - Component\n    - 8B pooled (exp-001)\n    - Qwen3-14B\n    - DeepSeek-R1-14B\n    rows:\n    - - item_id\n      - 24.0%\n      - 20.0%\n      - 10.0%\n    - - residual\n      - 27.9%\n      - 30.0%\n      - 42.0%\n    - - temp:item\n      - 5.5%\n      - 4.8%\n      - 12.0%\n    - - seed:item\n      - 1.8%\n      - 1.5%\n      - 8.5%\n  figures_description:\n  - 'Grouped bar chart: 8B pooled vs Qwen3-14B vs DeepSeek-R1-14B的top-5 variance components，展示scale/architecture对方差profile的影响。DeepSeek的reasoning-distilled特性导致方差结构质性不同。'\n  analysis: '即使partial执行，DeepSeek-R1-14B的异常方差结构（residual=42%）进一步瓦解了 universal item\n    dominance叙事。但hardware confound无法排除（单GPU结果）， 且sample size=2个14B模型太少做scale-effect的causal\n    claim。reframe中作为 supplementary evidence用，不作为独立contribution。\n\n    '\n- name: Fine-tuning G-study (RoBERTa)\n  plan_id: exp-006\n  description: 'RoBERTa-large on SST-2/MNLI/RTE/COPA。6 seeds × 3 learning rates ×\n    4 data shuffles × 3 GPUs × 2 precisions = 432 runs/task × 4 tasks = 1,728 runs。\n\n    '\n  expected_results:\n    item_variance_share_sst2: 0.15\n    item_variance_share_mnli: 0.12\n    item_variance_share_rte: 0.2\n    item_variance_share_copa: 0.08\n    learning_rate_main_effect_avg: 0.18\n    seed_main_effect_avg: 0.08\n    data_shuffle_main_effect_avg: 0.06\n    precision_main_effect_avg: 0.02\n    lr_seed_interaction_avg: 0.1\n    residual_avg: 0.22\n    g_coefficient_sst2: 0.55\n    g_coefficient_rte: 0.48\n    g_coefficient_copa: 0.35\n    training_vs_inference_variance_correlation: 0.15\n  result_rationale: 'Fine-tuning的方差结构与inference fundamentally不同。Learning rate是最大的\n    可归因方差来源（~18%），因为它直接控制模型converge到loss landscape的哪个 basin，不同basin对不同items的predictions质性不同。seed:lr交互高达10%因为\n    不同seed的weight initialization在不同lr下converge到不同local minima。 item_id在fine-tuning中方差占比更低（8-20%），因为fine-tuning本身改变了\n    model-item的关系——同一个item在不同training run中的难度会变（unlike inference where model weights\n    are fixed）。COPA尤其低（8%）因为dataset 只有400 items，且causal reasoning tasks的learning dynamics更chaotic。\n    residual=22%反映了training过程中unmodeled的随机性（CUDA非确定性在训练中 比推理中更显著，因为每个gradient step都累积噪声）。与inference方差结构\n    的correlation极低（r=0.15），说明inference-based的D-study budget不能 指导training-time的reproducibility。这个发现独立于inference\n    story，可以 作为separate contribution线——即使inference的item dominance不成立， fine-tuning的方差归因本身也是novel的。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - name: 'Table 8: Fine-tuning Variance Decomposition by Task'\n    columns:\n    - Component\n    - SST-2\n    - MNLI\n    - RTE\n    - COPA\n    - Average\n    rows:\n    - - learning_rate\n      - 16.0%\n      - 20.0%\n      - 18.0%\n      - 17.0%\n      - 17.8%\n    - - residual\n      - 20.0%\n      - 22.0%\n      - 21.0%\n      - 25.0%\n      - 22.0%\n    - - item_id\n      - 15.0%\n      - 12.0%\n      - 20.0%\n      - 8.0%\n      - 13.8%\n    - - lr:seed\n      - 10.0%\n      - 11.0%\n      - 9.0%\n      - 10.0%\n      - 10.0%\n    - - seed\n      - 8.0%\n      - 7.0%\n      - 9.0%\n      - 8.0%\n      - 8.0%\n    - - data_shuffle\n      - 7.0%\n      - 6.0%\n      - 5.0%\n      - 6.0%\n      - 6.0%\n    - - seed:item\n      - 5.0%\n      - 4.0%\n      - 4.0%\n      - 6.0%\n      - 4.8%\n    - - precision\n      - 2.0%\n      - 2.5%\n      - 1.8%\n      - 2.2%\n      - 2.1%\n    - - lr:item\n      - 8.0%\n      - 7.0%\n      - 6.0%\n      - 9.0%\n      - 7.5%\n    - - all other\n      - 9.0%\n      - 8.5%\n      - 6.2%\n      - 8.8%\n      - 8.1%\n  - name: 'Table 9: Inference vs Fine-tuning Variance Hierarchy'\n    columns:\n    - Rank\n    - Inference (MMLU)\n    - Fine-tuning (avg)\n    rows:\n    - - 1st\n      - residual (28%)\n      - residual (22%)\n    - - 2nd\n      - item_id (24%)\n      - learning_rate (18%)\n    - - 3rd\n      - temp:item (5.5%)\n      - item_id (14%)\n    - - 4th\n      - prompt:item (4.8%)\n      - lr:seed (10%)\n    - - 5th\n      - precision:item (3.5%)\n      - seed (8%)\n  figures_description:\n  - 'Side-by-side stacked bars: inference (exp-001 MMLU) vs fine-tuning (exp-006 average)的方差分解，颜色编码相同components以突出hierarchy的质性差异。'\n  - 'Scatter plot: 每个component在inference vs fine-tuning中的variance share，理想情况下应在diagonal上。worst档下points远离diagonal，r=0.15的correlation在plot上视觉明显。'\n  analysis: 'exp-006在worst档下是最有价值的hedge。即使inference story崩溃，fine-tuning的 方差归因是genuinely\n    novel的——此前没有研究用G-theory分解fine-tuning的完整 facet structure。learning rate dominance（18%）、lr:seed交互（10%）、以及\n    inference-training方差结构的decorrelation（r=0.15）都是publishable findings。 这条线可以独立于inference\n    story发展，在worst档下成为paper的saving grace。 potential title angle: \"What makes fine-tuning\n    unreproducible? A G-theory decomposition reveals learning rate × seed interactions\n    dominate.\"\n\n    '\n- name: LayerCast precision mitigation\n  plan_id: exp-007\n  description: 'LayerCast（FP16 storage + FP32 compute）作为额外precision条件测试方差减少量。\n\n    '\n  expected_results:\n    layercast_accuracy: 0.672\n    layercast_vs_bf16_accuracy_delta: 0.001\n    variance_reduction_vs_fp16: 0.003\n    precision_component_with_layercast: 0.012\n    precision_item_interaction_with_layercast: 0.03\n    practical_significance: negligible\n  result_rationale: '在worst档下，exp-001已经显示precision main effect仅1.5%（confound修复后）。\n    LayerCast的FP16 storage + FP32 compute在理论上应该给出接近FP32的结果，但 由于FP32本身与BF16/FP16的差异已经很小（Δaccuracy=0.002），LayerCast的\n    额外收益几乎为零。precision:item交互从3.5%微降到3.0%，不具有实际意义。 这个结果说明precision本来就不是主要方差来源（confound修复后），mitigation\n    策略针对的是一个已经很小的问题。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - name: 'Table 10: Precision Conditions Including LayerCast'\n    columns:\n    - Condition\n    - Accuracy\n    - Precision Variance Share\n    - Precision:Item Share\n    rows:\n    - - FP32\n      - '0.670'\n      - 1.5%\n      - 3.5%\n    - - BF16\n      - '0.672'\n      - —\n      - —\n    - - FP16\n      - '0.671'\n      - —\n      - —\n    - - LayerCast (FP16+FP32)\n      - '0.672'\n      - 1.2%\n      - 3.0%\n  figures_description:\n  - 'Bar chart with error bars: 4种precision条件的accuracy分布，展示LayerCast与BF16几乎重叠，视觉上传达''precision\n    mitigation对一个已经很小的问题没有意义''。'\n  analysis: 'exp-007在worst档下基本是negative/null result。可以用一句话mention作为 supplementary\n    finding（\"LayerCast provides negligible additional benefit when the float32 engine\n    confound is properly controlled\"），但不值得 dedicated space。主要价值是排除了precision作为重要方差来源的可能性。\n\n    '\n- name: MATH benchmark extension\n  plan_id: exp-008\n  description: 'MATH benchmark 200 items，测试reasoning-heavy tasks中CoT引入的额外方差。\n\n    '\n  expected_results:\n    item_variance_share_math: 0.1\n    residual_share_math: 0.4\n    seed_main_effect_math: 0.07\n    seed_item_interaction_math: 0.12\n    temperature_main_effect_math: 0.1\n    temperature_item_interaction_math: 0.15\n    prompt_item_interaction_math: 0.03\n    g_coefficient_math: 0.3\n    cot_length_variance_correlation: 0.65\n    items_needed_g90_math: 2200\n  result_rationale: 'MATH是最extreme的reasoning benchmark，CoT生成过程中的每个token都是一个 采样点，长推理链（avg\n    200+ tokens）意味着seed和temperature的随机性被200+ 次multiplicative放大。因此seed:item（12%）和temperature:item（15%）极高，\n    temperature main effect达10%（在其他benchmark上<2%），因为temperature 直接控制采样diversity，在长chain中的累积效应是非线性的。item_id仅10%——\n    比GSM8K更低——因为MATH problems的难度更多由解题路径的存在性决定，而非 item本身的知识内容，solution path的发现受seed/temperature强烈影响。\n    residual高达40%是worst档中最高的，反映了MATH推理过程中大量不可归因的 随机性（错误的推理链、self-correction失败、格式解析错误等）。G=0.30是\n    所有benchmark中最低的，G≥0.90需要2200 items，完全不切实际（MATH全集仅 5000题）。这个结果是\"no universal recipe\"论点的最强证据——如果连G≥0.90\n    的item threshold在不同benchmark间差3-4倍，prescriptive budget毫无意义。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - name: 'Table 11: MATH Variance Decomposition vs Other Benchmarks'\n    columns:\n    - Component\n    - MMLU\n    - GSM8K\n    - MATH\n    rows:\n    - - residual\n      - 28%\n      - 35%\n      - 40%\n    - - item_id\n      - 24%\n      - 12%\n      - 10%\n    - - temp:item\n      - 5.5%\n      - 18%\n      - 15%\n    - - seed:item\n      - 1.8%\n      - 14%\n      - 12%\n    - - temperature\n      - 1.2%\n      - 8%\n      - 10%\n    - - seed\n      - 0.3%\n      - 5%\n      - 7%\n    - - G coefficient\n      - '0.42'\n      - '0.38'\n      - '0.30'\n    - - Items for G≥0.90\n      - '850'\n      - '1400'\n      - '2200'\n  figures_description:\n  - 'Scatter plot: CoT生成长度(tokens) vs item-level accuracy variance，展示正相关（r=0.65）——推理链越长，evaluation\n    variance越大。这是mechanistic explanation。'\n  - 'Gradient spectrum bar: 从MMLU→ARC→HellaSwag→GSM8K→MATH的G coefficient递减趋势，visual\n    argument for benchmark-conditional variance。'\n  analysis: MATH是worst档叙事的exclamation mark。G=0.30意味着当前practice下MATH evaluation基本是noise-dominated的。结合exp-002的GSM8K结果，形成清晰的\n    gradient：knowledge-retrieval tasks（MMLU）→ moderate reasoning（ARC）→ generation-heavy\n    reasoning（GSM8K/MATH）的方差结构systematically shifts from item-conditional to seed/temperature-conditional。这个gradient本身\n    是一个contribution——它解释了为什么reasoning benchmark的reproduction rates historically更低，并提供了mechanistic\n    account（CoT length amplifies sampling noise）。\n","numLines":715,"startLine":1,"totalLines":715}}}
{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-4-6","id":"msg_01Gv4KxPvYcpT27QSZp7uH8h","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_01E6QwiD7W4yHP5Bazk5ZTG2","name":"ToolSearch","input":{"query":"select:submit_dream_review_report","max_results":1},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":11383,"cache_read_input_tokens":11841,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":11383},"output_tokens":33,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"56dac4e5-2ce5-4fbd-b248-0bfac99e4894","uuid":"a2d84fc9-c8aa-4a7a-9738-b79869068ed5"}
